OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStarting off mainly dry with
OL,6,Fsome brightness. Then becoming cloudy
OL,7,Fat times with showers or occasionally
OL,8,Flonger spells of rain spreading from
OL,9,Fthe west. Windy with fresh to strong
OL,10,Fsouth or southwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see further
OL,13,Fshowers. Then variable amounts of
OL,14,Fcloud overnight with showers, these
OL,15,Fturning fewer across Orkney later.
OL,16,FFresh to strong west or southwesterly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
