OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright spells and occasional
OL,6,Fshowers, but more in the way of drier
OL,7,Fweather. Strong northwesterly winds at
OL,8,Ffirst across Shetland, otherwise less
OL,9,Fwindy than of late.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith showers on Saturday, strong
OL,13,Fsouthwesterly winds. Bright spells and
OL,14,Ffewer showers on Sunday, fresh
OL,15,Fwesterly winds. Rain extending
OL,16,Fnortheast for a time on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
